# UC10 - Count Total Seats in Train

## Objective
Calculate total seating capacity using Stream reduce().

## Problem in UC9
Grouping organizes data but gives no total metrics.

## Solution
Use:
- map() to extract capacities
- reduce() to sum values

## Example
72 + 56 + 24 + 70 = 222

## Output
Total Seating Capacity of Train: 222

## Benefits
- Functional aggregation
- Real analytics support
- Cleaner than manual loops